{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 366,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "嗨，大家好，好久不见\nHi everyone, long time no see"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4566,
    "dDurationMs": 4267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "最近我都没怎么出门因为\nI haven't been going out much lately, because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10066,
    "dDurationMs": 2667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "7月在上海\nin July, in Shanghai,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12733,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "天气真的不怎么样\nthe weather is really not great"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15366,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "先是连续不断的梅雨季\nFirst came the endless plum rain season"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19233,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "每天都下雨\nIt rained every day"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21800,
    "dDurationMs": 3066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "又潮湿又闷热\nHumid and muggy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25366,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后这几天上海又受到台风的影响\nAnd these past few days, Shanghai has been affected by a typhoon"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29766,
    "dDurationMs": 1767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我也不太敢出门\nSo I haven't really dared to go out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31966,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你们可以看到今天风还是挺大的\nYou can see the wind is still pretty strong today"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34966,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "不过从明天周一起\nBut starting tomorrow, Monday,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38233,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "上海应该就不太受台风的影响了\nShanghai shouldn't be affected by the typhoon much anymore"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43033,
    "dDurationMs": 3167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那其实今天我也不是要出门\nActually, I'm not really \"going out\" today"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46400,
    "dDurationMs": 3566,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我只是要去我的邻居朋友家\nI'm just going to my neighbor friend's place"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50033,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "帮她照顾一下小猫\nto help take care of her cat"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52833,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为她最近去别的城市出差了\nbecause she's away on a business trip in another city"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57033,
    "dDurationMs": 2933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后我也就是想跟你们分享一下\nAnd I just wanted to share with you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59966,
    "dDurationMs": 3034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我这几天照顾小猫的心得\nwhat I've learned from taking care of the cat these past few days"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63666,
    "dDurationMs": 3967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为我是没有养宠物的经验的\nBecause I have zero experience with pets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67733,
    "dDurationMs": 1267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后我发现\nAnd I've found that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69800,
    "dDurationMs": 6533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "和小猫相处比我想象中的要复杂很多\ngetting along with a cat is way more complicated than I imagined"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76833,
    "dDurationMs": 1967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "也并不是那么顺利\nIt hasn't gone all that smoothly either"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79200,
    "dDurationMs": 3133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为可能我们不养宠物的人\nMaybe because those of us without pets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82400,
    "dDurationMs": 3366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "对于小猫小狗的认知都是来源于\nget all our ideas about cats and dogs from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86466,
    "dDurationMs": 1367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "网上的视频\nvideos online"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87833,
    "dDurationMs": 3767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "比如说你可以开心的摸摸它\nLike, you can just happily pet them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92400,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "在中文里我们会叫\nIn Chinese we call it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95733,
    "dDurationMs": 1733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "撸猫撸狗\n\"lū māo lū gǒu\" (stroking cats and dogs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97733,
    "dDurationMs": 2233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "和它玩，它很听话\nYou play with them, they're well-behaved"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100166,
    "dDurationMs": 1167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "也不反抗\nThey don't resist"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101766,
    "dDurationMs": 1634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "随便你怎么摸\nYou can pet them however you like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103966,
    "dDurationMs": 3834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但是现实中往往不是这样的\nBut in reality, it's often not like that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107966,
    "dDurationMs": 4834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那本来我朋友给我的任务就是每天\nOriginally, the task my friend gave me was to go every day,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112800,
    "dDurationMs": 5333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "或者每隔两天就去她家帮小猫铲屎\nor every other day, to her place to scoop the cat's poop"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118533,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "对，去它拉便便的盆子里帮它铲屎\nYes, to scoop the poop out of its litter box"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124633,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "说到铲屎\nSpeaking of scooping poop,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125833,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我想教你们一个词\nI want to teach you a word"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127766,
    "dDurationMs": 3367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "就是在中文里最近比较火的一个词\nA word that's quite trendy in Chinese lately"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131133,
    "dDurationMs": 1867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "叫做“铲屎官”\nIt's called \"chǎnshǐguān\" (poop-scooping officer)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133966,
    "dDurationMs": 1767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "“官”的意思就是官员\n\"Guān\" means an official"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136133,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "尤其是古代那种比较大\nEspecially the high-ranking,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138433,
    "dDurationMs": 2933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "比较正式的政府的官\nformal government officials of ancient times"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142266,
    "dDurationMs": 3267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但是他们把“官”加在“铲屎”后面\nBut when people add \"guān\" after \"scooping poop\","
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145766,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "就有一种自嘲的感觉\nit has a self-deprecating feel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151666,
    "dDurationMs": 2767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "把铲屎当做一种工作\ntreating poop-scooping as a job"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155033,
    "dDurationMs": 3767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "其实我觉得这个词也很有意思\nActually, I think this word is really interesting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158800,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为它也是在告诉想养宠物的人\nbecause it's also telling people who want a pet:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163833,
    "dDurationMs": 2933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "养宠物并不只是它们给你\nhaving a pet isn't just about them giving you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166766,
    "dDurationMs": 3067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "提供陪伴或者休闲娱乐\ncompanionship or entertainment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169866,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你也是有责任的\nYou have responsibilities too"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172066,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "而铲屎就是最基础的一种\nAnd scooping poop is the most basic one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174666,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "哎呀这风太大了\nWhoa, this wind is so strong"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177500,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以今天这个视频\nSo in today's video,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179333,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我并不会带你们出门玩\nI won't be taking you out anywhere fun"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181966,
    "dDurationMs": 2234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我现在要去我朋友的家\nI'm heading to my friend's place now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184366,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后我想看看能不能录到一点\nAnd I want to see if I can film a bit of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187566,
    "dDurationMs": 2967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我和小猫互动的视频给你们看\nme interacting with the cat to show you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191066,
    "dDurationMs": 4634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后如果你们当中有资深的养猫人士\nAnd if any of you are experienced cat owners,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195866,
    "dDurationMs": 2067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "也可以给我提供一些经验\nfeel free to share some tips with me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198133,
    "dDurationMs": 2633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为我也是打算可能在\nBecause I'm actually planning, maybe"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200766,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "今年年底就开始养一只小猫\nby the end of this year, to get a cat myself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204566,
    "dDurationMs": 2334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那就看看今天我到\nSo let's see, when I get to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206900,
    "dDurationMs": 2366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "朋友家录视频的时候\nmy friend's place and start filming,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209566,
    "dDurationMs": 2767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它赏不赏脸吧\nwhether the cat will grace us with its presence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212333,
    "dDurationMs": 3967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "说不定它都不愿意出现在摄像头中\nMaybe it won't even want to appear on camera"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217200,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在我要先进行一个铲屎的工作\nNow, first, I shall perform my poop-scooping duties"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222100,
    "dDurationMs": 3266,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它对于这个新相机超级好奇呢\nShe's super curious about this new camera"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228466,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "嘿嘿\nHehe"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232333,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "涨薪，涨薪\nZhangxin, Zhangxin"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236466,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这只小猫叫“涨薪”\nThis cat is called \"Zhǎngxīn\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240000,
    "dDurationMs": 3366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "其实zhǎngxīn有两个不同的意思\nActually, \"zhǎngxīn\" has two different meanings"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243566,
    "dDurationMs": 1134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "怎么说呢\nHow do I put it..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245533,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它的主人给它取的名字就是“涨薪水”\nThe name her owner gave her means \"get a raise\" (涨薪水)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251300,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为她希望自己薪水能\nbecause she hopes her salary can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253733,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "慢慢慢慢的越来越多\nslowly, slowly keep growing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256566,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但是我们还有一个zhǎngxīn\nBut there's another \"zhǎngxīn\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258700,
    "dDurationMs": 1766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "就是这个掌心\nwhich is this one: 掌心"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260800,
    "dDurationMs": 1766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "手掌的中心\nthe center of your palm"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 263166,
    "dDurationMs": 3534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以你们知道有时候确实要看汉字\nSo you see, sometimes you really need the characters"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266700,
    "dDurationMs": 3966,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "和语境才能知道我们说的是哪个词\nand the context to know which word we mean"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274366,
    "dDurationMs": 3167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "涨薪，我给你买了新的玩具\nZhangxin, I bought you new toys"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278100,
    "dDurationMs": 3066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但是我不知道质量怎么样\nBut I don't know how good the quality is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282466,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这是一个弹力球\nThis is a bouncy ball"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286200,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后上面有一个小的羽毛\nwith a little feather on top"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291333,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为涨薪在我来的时候\nBecause when I first came, Zhangxin"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294733,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它只有一个逗猫棒\nonly had one cat teaser wand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296666,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后我发现\nAnd I noticed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298333,
    "dDurationMs": 2533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它已经对逗猫棒失去了兴趣\nshe'd already lost interest in it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300866,
    "dDurationMs": 2234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以我从昨天开始就\nSo starting yesterday, I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303100,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "买了一些新的玩具\nbought her some new toys"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305666,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为我前几天刚开始照顾它的时候\nBecause when I first started taking care of her,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310066,
    "dDurationMs": 3067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我发现我有一个错误的地方\nI realized I was making a mistake:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313200,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "就是我会用手陪它玩\nI would play with her using my hands"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316166,
    "dDurationMs": 2834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后它就特别喜欢咬我手\nAnd she loved biting my hand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319300,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我就去想为什么\nSo I tried to figure out why"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321366,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "就是因为每次它咬我手\nIt's because every time she bit my hand,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323466,
    "dDurationMs": 2834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我就会习惯性的\nI would habitually,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326333,
    "dDurationMs": 1633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "本能的抽回\ninstinctively pull it back"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328066,
    "dDurationMs": 3134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这就跟它在自然里看到的猎物一样\nwhich is exactly like the prey she'd see in nature"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331200,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "对吧？涨薪它原来是生活在街道上的\nRight? Zhangxin used to live on the streets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335400,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它几个月大的时候\nWhen she was a few months old,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337166,
    "dDurationMs": 1834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "主人把它捡回来\nher owner took her in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339733,
    "dDurationMs": 1867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后我就开始\nSo I started —"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341700,
    "dDurationMs": 3233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "先是用这些玩具去让它\nfirst, using these toys to let her"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344966,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "释放一些它捕猎的天性\nrelease some of her hunting instincts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347733,
    "dDurationMs": 4333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后我的手可能就对它失去了\nThat way, my hand would probably lose"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352066,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "原来那种猎物的吸引力\nits original prey-like appeal to her"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355733,
    "dDurationMs": 1867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "其次我改的就是\nThe second thing I changed:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357866,
    "dDurationMs": 1734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它如果再要咬我的手\nif she tries to bite my hand again,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359600,
    "dDurationMs": 1766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我会放在那里不动\nI keep it still, not moving,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361400,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "让它看起来不那么像猎物\nso it looks less like prey"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364600,
    "dDurationMs": 1333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后它再咬\nAnd if she bites again,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365933,
    "dDurationMs": 3267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我就会发出“嘶——”的声音提醒它\nI make a \"hiss—\" sound to warn her"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369466,
    "dDurationMs": 1934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后它好像真的能听懂\nAnd she really seems to understand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371400,
    "dDurationMs": 3866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "能看出我不喜欢它咬我手\nShe can tell I don't like her biting my hand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382066,
    "dDurationMs": 1934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "还有一个新的逗猫棒\nThere's also a new teaser wand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384000,
    "dDurationMs": 3933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它就是长得跟棒棒糖一样\nIt looks just like a lollipop"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387933,
    "dDurationMs": 2967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后下面也吊了一根\nwith a feather hanging from it —"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390900,
    "dDurationMs": 2533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "对猫很有吸引力的羽毛\nthe kind cats find irresistible"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394066,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "涨薪\nZhangxin"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399633,
    "dDurationMs": 2467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后我看网上别人说\nI read online that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 402866,
    "dDurationMs": 1967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "动这个逗猫棒的时候\nwhen you move the teaser wand,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404833,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "要让它不那么有规律的动\nyou should move it irregularly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408066,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为自然界里的猎物\nbecause prey in nature"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410633,
    "dDurationMs": 2233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "动起来也是没有规律的\ndoesn't move in regular patterns either"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420800,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它现在在观察\nShe's observing now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464866,
    "dDurationMs": 2734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "还是引起了一些它的兴趣的哦\nIt did catch her interest a little!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471500,
    "dDurationMs": 2133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "爱玩儿是好事\nLoving to play is a good thing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482066,
    "dDurationMs": 2767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它现在身上还穿着绝育服\nShe's still wearing her recovery suit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 484833,
    "dDurationMs": 3467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为它大概一周前刚做完绝育\nbecause she was spayed about a week ago"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488666,
    "dDurationMs": 2634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后这个绝育的小衣服就是\nThis little recovery outfit is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 491300,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "保护它的伤口的\nto protect her wound"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493266,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以我现在也不敢让它动太多\nSo I don't dare let her move too much right now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496700,
    "dDurationMs": 3533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为可能伤口还没有完全恢复好\nsince the wound may not be fully healed yet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503066,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这么快就失去兴趣了今天\nLost interest that fast today, huh"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506633,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "涨薪\nZhangxin"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518533,
    "dDurationMs": 1933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后我看网上说\nI also read online that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 520466,
    "dDurationMs": 1167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "陪它们玩之后\nafter playing with them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521633,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "要给它们喂点零食\nyou should feed them a little treat"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523666,
    "dDurationMs": 1367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这样它们就真的会\nThat way they'll really"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525033,
    "dDurationMs": 2633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "觉得自己捕到猎一样\nfeel like they caught their prey"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 528466,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "哎，人类真的是能想出各种办法\nWow, humans really can come up with anything"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532233,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这个你吃吗？\nWill you eat this one?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 539933,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那还是吃的\nOkay, so you do eat it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543833,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "看来你不喜欢这个黄色的零食\nLooks like you don't like this yellow treat"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 546400,
    "dDurationMs": 2833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那我以后不喂你了\nFine, I won't feed you this one anymore"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551266,
    "dDurationMs": 3634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它现在想跟我保持一定的距离\nShe wants to keep some distance from me right now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555266,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那我就让它这样自己待着\nSo I'll just let her be on her own"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 559266,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为不管是动物还是人\nBecause whether it's animals or people,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 562800,
    "dDurationMs": 2533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我们都要有一定的边界感\nwe all need a sense of boundaries"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566900,
    "dDurationMs": 4933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "就是不能总是主动往对方身上靠\nYou can't always be the one leaning in on the other"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 572800,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "对不对，涨薪？\nRight, Zhangxin?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 575566,
    "dDurationMs": 3334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它特别喜欢这样踩在我的脚上\nShe really loves standing on my feet like this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 579833,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "涨薪~\nZhangxin~"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582466,
    "dDurationMs": 2167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后我发现现在伸手给它\nAnd I've found that now when I offer her my hand,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 584700,
    "dDurationMs": 2566,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它好像真的不咬了，你看\nshe really doesn't bite anymore — look"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 588133,
    "dDurationMs": 2767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它反倒是贴过来让我摸\nInstead, she comes close and lets me pet her"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 593266,
    "dDurationMs": 1434,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后我就觉得这几天\nSo I feel like these past few days,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 594700,
    "dDurationMs": 2566,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "好像真的找对了点方法\nI've really found some of the right methods"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 597366,
    "dDurationMs": 3367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "还是有那么一点小小的成就感的\nIt does give me a tiny sense of achievement"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600833,
    "dDurationMs": 4633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "感觉自己做铲屎官达到了合格线吧\nI feel like as a \"poop-scooping officer\", I've reached the passing line"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605500,
    "dDurationMs": 966,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "60分\n60 out of 100"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 607066,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后我也很开心我朋友就是能信任我\nAnd I'm really happy my friend trusted me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 611166,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "让我在这几天这样去照顾小猫\nto take care of her cat these past few days"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616300,
    "dDurationMs": 2666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后也让我对于自己以后\nIt's also made me feel more confident"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 618966,
    "dDurationMs": 2934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "要养宠物更加有把握了\nabout having a pet of my own in the future"
    } ]
  } ]
}
